                                                "sense_id": "e2d21558-eb3d-30da-87ec-785cb22cc5ed",
                                                "text": "I have drunk en-ee-cee-tee-ay-ar from the ef-ell-oh-doubleyou-ee-ar-ess in his gee-ay-ar-dee-ee-en many a time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
